      "content": "The synthetic frame is only used by `reviewItem`; `assembleTrade` immediately calls `figuresOf` with the original frames, and that helper still requires an underlying frame. On Monday, an expired option with no stock trade sharing its underlying (T-3/MNO in the requirement) therefore opens successfully in the overview but throws `Market Data returned no frame for MNO` when its card is opened. Carry the no-Mark/post-expiration handling through the card's figures assembly as well, and add a `getTrade` regression test for that case.",
