      "path": "src/ui/screens/review-attention.ts",
      "content": "`attentionOf` now emits `SettlementDue` as the sole reason for an otherwise coherent settlement-due trade, so this branch makes `ReviewCard` render an empty paragraph under its Blocker heading. Provide at least a settlement-due sentence for this variant instead of returning an empty string; an explicit case also preserves detection of future unhandled reasons.",
